# Marketing drum commerce (Cursor)

## Mission

Turn **manifests and release briefs** into sellable copy — not into unverified product claims.

## Read before writing

- `LICENSING.md`, `disklordz-ralph/STACK-FROZEN.md`
- `docs/dev/marketing-agents-claude-cursor.md`
- Latest `manifest.json` or `dist_sample_pack/manifest.json`

## Outputs

| Destination | Allowed without explicit approval |
|-------------|-----------------------------------|
| `docs/launch/*.md` | Yes (drafts) |
| `docs/outreach/drafts/*.md` | Yes |
| `storefront/*.html` | **No** — operator must say storefront is approved |

## Copy rules

- **Synthesis-only** drums unless manifest proves recorded WAV one-shots
- No copyrighted artist samples, no “AI-generated” vagueness, no iLok unless shipped
- Tiers: Lite ($0 lead magnet) → Core (VST + pack) → Suite — per `@agency-launch-strategist`
- BeatStars / Splice tone: technical, royalty-free, BPM/key if in manifest

## Handoffs

- Video: `@agency-short-video` → scripts in `docs/launch/shorts-*.md`
- OpenMontage: `docs/marketing/openmontage-prompt-templates.md` Template A/B
- Intel: read-only `openclaw/skills/shared/vst_market_intel/` — drafts only

## AutoGen

`factory_swarm.py` masters audio and presets; **marketing agent** writes listings from outputs — do not merge storefront API into factory swarm.